    per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase, if you control this
    Special Summoned card: You can add 1 \"Vaylantz\" Spell from your Deck to your
    hand. If this card in the Monster Zone moves to another Monster Zone: You can
    add 1 \"Vaylantz\" monster from your Deck to your hand, except \"Shinonome the
    Vaylantz Priestess\". You can only use each effect of \"Shinonome the Vaylantz
    Priestess\" once per turn."
